      {
        "id": "home-origin-story",
        "type": "editorial-media",
        "content": {
          "eyebrow": "OUR STORY",
          "title": "Every spring has a story to tell.",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Tronoša's story begins in a region where nature and heritage meet in a mystical way. At the Devet Jugovića spring, in the village of Korenita near Loznica, stories of water still murmur, as it finds its way to your table even today, seven centuries after the stone fountain was built.",
            "The spring's name echoes ancient legends, while the surrounding region preserves a rich cultural and natural heritage. It is precisely this origin that gives Tronoša its distinctive and strong character."
          ],
          "mediaPosition": "left",
          "media": {
            "kind": "image",
            "image": {
              "alt": "Devet Jugovića spring near Loznica, Serbia",
              "desktop": {
                "src": "/images/jug-bogdan-spring.webp",
                "width": 1600,
                "height": 1200
              }
            }
          },
          "cta": {
            "label": "Discover our story",
            "pageId": "about"
          }
        }
      },
